      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that was a good start. i actually have another set of reviews that are a bit more qualitative and less \"cookie cutter.\" these might be harder to summarize because the phrasing is a bit more subjective. can you do the same thing? just a paragraph for each person on character and leadership potential.\n\nGroup C:\n1. \"David: Has a very commanding presence in the room. He can be quite blunt, but he gets results and people follow his lead.\"\n2. \"Claire: Very focused on the technical details and incredibly hardworking. Sometimes she gets too caught up in the minutiae, but her output is huge.\"\n\nGroup D:\n1. \"Rohan: Has a very intense presence in the room. He can be quite blunt, but he gets results and people follow his lead.\"\n2. \"Layla: Very focused on the technical details and incredibly hardworking. Sometimes she gets too caught up in the minutiae, but her output is huge.\"",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
